  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Interact (Ingested)</p><p>The peach growing from a wildtwig’s horn is magical, tasting like the favorite fruit of the one who consumes it, providing them some temporary rejuvenation. A single fruit lasts for 8 hours after picked. When consumed as an Interact action, the peach provides temporary Hit Points equal to the creature’s level for 1 hour. Eating a second fruit within an hour provides no benefits, instead making the creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{sickened 1} for 10 minutes.</p>"
